  "title": "wlan-radio: Fix access of unitialized bool",
  "description": "phdr.phy_info.info_11b.short_preamble is not (always) initialized when\nhas_short_preamble is false, so don't access it, which is undefined\nbehavior at least in C++.\n\nIf we don't set it here, we always set it later in the\nassumed_short_preamble path if we need it.\n\nFix #19721",
